{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://redmagic.local/schemas/rig-config.schema.json",
  "title": "RigConfig",
  "description": "Un enemigo o jefe hecho de piezas sueltas (Assets/Scripts/Rigging/ProceduralRig.cs): la jerarquía bajo Visual, cada RigPart, todo ProceduralRig, sprites por estado, gestos, BossLimbs y lo que el cuerpo necesita de la raíz. Lo escribe RigConfigExporter y lo lee RigBundleImporter (Tools ▸ Web ▸ Rig).",
  "$comment": "MAPEO 1:1 con ProceduralRig: el bloque \"rig\" lleva cada campo por su nombre C# (el exportador los saca por reflexión, así que un campo nuevo de ProceduralRig aparece en el JSON solo: añádelo también aquí). Las piezas se referencian por RUTA relativa a Visual (\"Torso/RightArm/Muzzle\"); \"Visual\" es la raíz visual (ProceduralRig.body). Dos excepciones de forma, no de nombre: los campos de RigPart van dentro de su nodo en \"parts\" (swayMove/swayRotate/swayScale/swaySpeed/swayPhase agrupados en \"sway\"), y las listas estructuradas (spriteSwaps, gestures) tienen bloque propio. REIMPORTAR: el cuerpo sale siempre del JSON; una clave ausente conserva el valor que había y una lista presente sustituye a la entera. Ver docs/web-tools-guide.md (Rig) y COMPATIBILITY.md.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "name",
    "parts"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "$schema": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "kind": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "enemy",
        "boss"
      ],
      "default": "enemy",
      "$comment": "enemy = pila de enemigo (ProceduralRigTool.Setup) + enemy-config.json opcional en el bundle. boss = pila de jefe (BossBodyBuilder.AddBossStack) + BossLimbs + boss-config.json opcional (ataques y definición, sin \"body\")."
    },
    "driver": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "code",
        "dotween"
      ],
      "default": "code",
      "$comment": "Motor que lleva el prefab (un solo prefab, sin variantes): code = RigDriverCode. dotween = RigDriverTween (todavía no existe: el import falla alto)."
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "$comment": "Nombre del prefab: Assets/Prefabs/Enemies/Procedural/<name>.prefab (con su motor). Reimportar con el mismo nombre actualiza."
    },
    "pixelsPerUnit": {
      "type": "number",
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
      "default": 100,
      "$comment": "IMPORTER-ONLY. PPU por defecto de los PNG del bundle (los sprites \"Assets/…\" no se tocan)."
    },
    "sprites": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "pixelsPerUnit": {
            "type": "number",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0
          },
          "pivot": {
            "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
          }
        }
      },
      "$comment": "IMPORTER-ONLY. Ajustes de import de cada PNG del bundle, por su ruta relativa: pixelsPerUnit y pivot NORMALIZADO (0..1; 0.5/0.5 = centro). La web recorta cada pieza y manda aquí su pivote."
    },
    "root": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "scale": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "Número = escala uniforme (x = y = z). {x, y} = z a 1."
        },
        "tag": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "layer": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "feet": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2",
          "$comment": "Sólo jefes. Posición local (en la raíz) de un hijo vacío 'Feet' = BossController.feet: lo que se planta en el suelo y desde donde los ataques miden alturas, para que la raíz (pivote) vaya en el centro del cuerpo. Ausente = la raíz es la base."
        }
      },
      "$comment": "Transform de la raíz del prefab (escala) + etiqueta y capa. La raíz es el pivote: el centro del cuerpo."
    },
    "collider": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "type"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "box",
            "capsule",
            "circle"
          ]
        },
        "size": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "offset": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "radius": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "direction": {
          "enum": [
            "Vertical",
            "Horizontal"
          ]
        },
        "isTrigger": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "El collider del cuerpo en la raíz (uno solo: los de otro tipo se quitan). box/capsule usan size; circle, radius."
    },
    "corpse": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "linger": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "fadeDuration": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "Corpse.linger / fadeDuration: las piezas necesitan tiempo para caer al morir."
    },
    "visual": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "position": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "rotation": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "scale": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "Número = escala uniforme (x = y = z). {x, y} = z a 1."
        }
      },
      "$comment": "Transform local de Visual (ProceduralRig.body)."
    },
    "parts": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/node"
      },
      "$comment": "Todos los nodos bajo Visual. Los de rigPart (por defecto) forman ProceduralRig.parts EN ESTE ORDEN; los demás (Muzzle, Grip, pivotes vacíos) sólo existen en la jerarquía. Un nodo del prefab que no esté aquí se borra al importar (y se avisa)."
    },
    "rig": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "hoverBob": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "hoverSpeed": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "leanDegrees": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "leanFullSpeed": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "leanResponse": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "followStiffness": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "followDamping": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "followMaxOffset": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "moveGesture": {
          "type": "string",
          "$comment": "Nombre de un gesto de \"gestures\" que se mantiene al desplazarse. Vacío = ninguno."
        },
        "aimPart": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "ProceduralRig.aimPart (Transform): ruta de la pieza bajo Visual, o null."
        },
        "aimArtAngle": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "aimMaxAngle": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "windup": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "recover": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "windupPullAngle": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "windupBodyTilt": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "recoilDelay": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "recoilKick": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "recoilAngle": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "recoilDistance": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "bodyRecoil": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "muzzle": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "ProceduralRig.muzzle (Transform): ruta de la pieza bajo Visual, o null."
        },
        "muzzleFlashSprite": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteRef"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "ProceduralRig.muzzleFlashSprite. null = el cuadrado de AbilityFx."
        },
        "muzzleFlashColor": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/color"
        },
        "muzzleFlashSize": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "muzzleFlashTime": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "stretchPart": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "ProceduralRig.stretchPart (Transform): ruta de la pieza bajo Visual, o null."
        },
        "stretchRiders": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
          },
          "$comment": "ProceduralRig.stretchRiders (List<Transform>)."
        },
        "foldedStretch": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "foldedRiderScaleY": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "foldedRiderOffset": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "wakeDuration": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "sleepDuration": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "wakeOvershoot": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "wakeFlickers": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "wakeFlickerPortion": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "drivenLease": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "drivenReturn": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "staggerStrength": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "hurtDuration": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "hurtTilt": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "hurtSquash": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "breakImpulse": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "breakUpward": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "breakSpin": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "breakGravity": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "breakBounce": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "breakGround": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/layerMask",
          "$comment": "ProceduralRig.breakGround (LayerMask), por nombres de capa."
        }
      },
      "$comment": "Los campos de ProceduralRig, 1:1 por nombre C# (menos body = Visual, parts, spriteSwaps y gestures)."
    },
    "spriteSwaps": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteSwap"
      },
      "$comment": "ProceduralRig.spriteSwaps."
    },
    "gestures": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/gesture"
      },
      "$comment": "ProceduralRig.gestures (los \"gesture\" de los ataques de jefe)."
    },
    "bossLimbs": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "limbs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
          }
        },
        "orbiters": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
          }
        },
        "orbiterRadius": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "grips": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
          }
        },
        "contactRadius": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "BossLimbs, 1:1 (piezas por ruta). Lo que los ataques de partes (Definitions/Rig) lanzan y dónde se agarran los objetos."
    },
    "bossBody": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "health": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "arenaHalfWidth": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "arenaHeight": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "activationRadius": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "contactDamage": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "definition": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/assetRef",
          "$comment": "Una BossDefinition que ya existe (la exporta RigConfigExporter). Se enlaza si el bundle no trae boss-config.json; si lo trae, manda la que crea ese import."
        },
        "bodyRenderer": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
        },
        "movement": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "params": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "$comment": "Sólo kind = boss. Mismas claves que BossConfig.body para la pila (las lee BossBodyBuilder.AddBossStack) + bodyRenderer (la pieza cuyo sprite copia el aura de aviso). La pila se escribe la primera vez o con \"resetear\"; bodyRenderer, siempre."
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "partPath": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "$comment": "Ruta de una pieza relativa a Visual (\"Torso/LeftFist\"), o \"Visual\" para la raíz visual."
    },
    "spriteRef": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "$comment": "\"Assets/…png\" (o \"Assets/…png#sprite\" en una hoja con varios) = sprite del proyecto, se usa tal cual. Cualquier otra = archivo del bundle relativo a su raíz (\"Parts/torso.png\"): se copia a Assets/Art/RigImports/<name>/ con los ajustes de \"sprites\"."
    },
    "node": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "$comment": "Sin \"/\". Ruta = parent/name, única."
        },
        "parent": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "$comment": "Ruta del padre bajo Visual; \"\" = hijo directo de Visual."
        },
        "sprite": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteRef"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "Con la clave = SpriteRenderer. Sin ella = nodo vacío (se le quita el renderer si lo tenía)."
        },
        "sortingOrder": {
          "type": "integer",
          "default": 0
        },
        "sortingLayer": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "Default"
        },
        "color": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/color"
        },
        "flipX": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "flipY": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "position": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "rotation": {
          "type": "number",
          "$comment": "Grados (Z local)."
        },
        "scale": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "Número = escala uniforme (x = y = z). {x, y} = z a 1."
        },
        "active": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        },
        "rigPart": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "$comment": "false = no entra en ProceduralRig.parts (bocas, agarres, pivotes)."
        },
        "pivot": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "center": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "pointAngle": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "leanFollow": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "sway": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "move": {
              "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
            },
            "rotate": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "scale": {
              "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
            },
            "speed": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "phase": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "$comment": "RigPart.swayMove / swayRotate / swayScale / swaySpeed / swayPhase."
        },
        "breaksOnDeath": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "Un Transform bajo Visual. pivot/center/pointAngle/leanFollow/sway/breaksOnDeath = los campos de RigPart (sólo con rigPart)."
    },
    "spriteSwap": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "part"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "part": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
        },
        "asleep": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteRef"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "awake": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteRef"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "attacking": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteRef"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "stages": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/spriteRef"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "$comment": "RigSpriteSwap: renderer = el de la pieza \"part\"."
    },
    "pose": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "part": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/partPath"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "move": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        },
        "rotate": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "scale": {
          "$ref": "_shared.schema.json#/definitions/vector2"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "RigPose."
    },
    "gesture": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "windup": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/pose"
          }
        },
        "strike": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/pose"
          }
        },
        "strikeTime": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "recover": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "shake": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "RigGesture."
    }
  }
}
